This directory contains prebuilt binaries for `trace_processor_shell`.
These are used by FlickerLib to parse and analyze perfetto traces.
They replace the binaries provided in the AndroidX library at build time.

### How to update the binaries?

Update x86_64 and x86 binaries:

```
. build/envsetup.sh && lunch aosp_cf_x86_64_phone-trunk_staging-userdebug

m trace_processor_shell

cp out/target/product/vsoc_x86_64/system/bin/trace_processor_shell prebuilts/misc/common/flickerlib/trace_processor_shell/trace_processor_shell_x86_64

cp out/host/linux-x86/bin/trace_processor_shell prebuilts/misc/common/flickerlib/trace_processor_shell/trace_processor_shell_x86
```

Update aarch64 binary:
```
. build/envsetup.sh && lunch husky-trunk_staging-userdebug

m trace_processor_shell

cp out/target/product/husky/system/bin/trace_processor_shell prebuilts/misc/common/flickerlib/trace_processor_shell/trace_processor_shell_aarch64
```

Update arm binary:
```
. build/envsetup.sh && aosp_arm64-trunk_staging-userdebug

m trace_processor_shell

cp out/target/product/generic_arm64/system/bin/trace_processor_shell prebuilts/misc/common/flickerlib/trace_processor_shell/trace_processor_shell_arm
```